1
00:00:02,127 --> 00:00:06,127
(Sheldon:)If a photon is directed through a plane
with two slits in it and either is observed...

2
00:00:06,297 --> 00:00:08,837
(Sheldon:)...it will not go through both.
If unobserved, it will.

3
00:00:09,009 --> 00:00:12,259
If it's observed after it left the plane,
before it hits its target...

4
00:00:12,429 --> 00:00:15,269
(Sheldon:)- ...it will not have gone through both slits.
- Agreed.

5
00:00:15,432 --> 00:00:16,562
(Leonard:)What's your point?

6
00:00:16,725 --> 00:00:19,685
(Sheldon:)There's no point,
I just think it's a good idea for a T-shirt.

7
00:00:25,233 --> 00:00:27,863
- Excuse me.
- Hang on.

8
00:00:31,197 --> 00:00:34,287
(Leonard:)One across is Aegean,
eight down is Nabokov.

9
00:00:34,451 --> 00:00:36,951
(Leonard:)Twenty-six across is MCM.

10
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:38,160
(Leonard:)Fourteen down is...

11
00:00:38,329 --> 00:00:40,169
(Leonard:)Move your finger.

12
00:00:40,331 --> 00:00:43,171
...phylum, which makes 14 across
Port-Au-Prince.

13
00:00:44,627 --> 00:00:48,627
(Leonard:)See, Papa Doc's capital idea,
that's Port-Au-Prince.

14
00:00:49,299 --> 00:00:50,879
(Leonard:)Haiti.

15
00:00:51,801 --> 00:00:53,181
- Can I help you?
- Yes.

16
00:00:55,513 --> 00:01:01,023
Um, is this the high-IQ sperm bank?

